  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environment Programme Preparation - SEPA-MENR Environment Programme Preparation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rberedelse av milj&#xf6;program i Ukraina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xe4;r den f&#xf6;rberedande fasen f&#xf6;r det institutionella samarbetet mellan Naturv&#xe5;rdsverket och Ukrainas milj&#xf6;ministerium f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rberedelserna f&#xf6;r milj&#xf6;programmet f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka Ukrainas regering att effektivt och effektivt hantera sina milj&#xf6;reformer inom omr&#xe5;dena anpassning av EU: s lagstiftning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is the preparatory phase for the institutional cooperation between Naturv&#xe5;rdsverket and the Ministry of Environment of Ukraine for the environment programme preparation to help strengthen  the capacity of the Government of Ukraine to effectively and efficiently manage its environment reforms in areas of EU legislation adaptation.</narrative>
  </description>
